WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.510
You can Special Summon it by 
discarding a card from your hand!

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.990
It can replace a Tuner Monster 
with "Synchron" in its name.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:21.130
Majestic Star Dragon attacks 
Earthbound Immortal Ccapac Apu!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.770
Shooting Blaster Sonic!

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.390
I couldn't hate you enough.

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:49.600
How embarrassing.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:54.970
I don't feel satisfied.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.580
Kiryu...

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:16.480
So you defeated Kiryu, Yusei Fudo.

00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:23.930
I can't afford to stop yet.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:38.600
It seems I'll have to settle our issues from 
17 years ago against your son, Professor Fudo.

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:56.320
Yusei!

00:01:57.610 --> 00:01:58.650
Yusei!

00:01:58.650 --> 00:01:59.860
Over here!

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:06.140
Yusei.

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:08.770
Look at that.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:20.620
Huh?  What happened to us?

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:22.590
I remember being surrounded by a black fog.

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:27.800
Who are they?

00:02:27.950 --> 00:02:30.280
They're…  I know!

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:35.170
By defeating Kiryu's Earthbound Immortal, 
the captured souls have returned!

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.680
Whoa!  That's awesome!

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:40.010
You did it, Yusei.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:40.670
Yeah.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:44.040
But it's too early to celebrate.

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:49.110
In order to close the gates to the 
underworld, we have to create two more seals.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:52.790
And there are still three 
Dark Signers remaining.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:55.400
What's wrong?

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:58.640
What's wrong, Ushio?

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:01.950
Everyone, get back!

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:03.960
What's going on?

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:04.870
Ushio?

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:08.930
Yusei, you finally defeated Kiryu.

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.730
Are you Rutger?

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.350
I'm your next opponent, Yusei.

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:19.290
If you want to battle me, 
come to the old Moment.

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:20.330
What?

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.030
What's wrong?

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:35.130
What will you do, Yusei?  It could be a trap.

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:39.130
Even if it's a trap, I have to battle him.

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:45.100
If I defeat his Earthbound Immortal, Martha, 
Rally and the other missing people will return.

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:47.070
Martha…

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:52.150
I'm going to the old Moment in 
order to finish things with Rutger!

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:10.830
Looking over a vast distance

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:15.780
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:20.740
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:25.460
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:30.820
No matter how bad today is

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:35.800
There's still the faintest light

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:41.210
All I have to do tomorrow

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:45.230
Is light it myself

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:50.300
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:55.250
Even if I get countless scars

00:04:55.750 --> 00:05:01.550
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:05.530
Today will never exist again

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:11.430
So I won't stop or vanish

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:40.650
The Promise 17 Years Ago
Destiny Guided by Moment

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:45.360
This is the main street in Neo 
Domino City's west fifth district.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:49.090
Martial law has been declared 
in Neo Domino City.

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:54.420
Mysterious geoglyphs appeared, and several 
hundred citizens have disappeared.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:57.760
I don't see any other people 
on this main street.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:00.010
Several days have passed since 
the incident, but there has

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:03.010
been no announcement from the 
Public Maintenance Department.

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:06.230
This leaves the people feeling uneasy.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:13.460
Despite what she says, it's impossible to 
explain this phenomenon to regular people.

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:28.800
Did Rex already leave?

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:30.800
Yes, just a little while ago.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:34.020
Then I'll believe in them.

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:38.250
We've been waiting for 
almost twenty years for

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:42.450
the brothers to turn the page 
in this world's history.

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:45.910
It is exactly as you say.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:10.470
Commander, this is far 
enough.  You can leave.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:17.450
But Director, never-before-seen phenomenons 
are occurring in Neo Domino City.

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:22.680
Our job is to protect you, 
even if it costs us our lives.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:29.510
I see.  But I don't think your weapons 
will work against the person I'm meeting.

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:50.180
We now control this area.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:54.870
Congratulations on making it this far, Rex.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.860
But who are these uncultured people?

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:01.110
This is their job.

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:06.680
I see, but we're going to 
have a complex conversation.

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:09.190
I want the two of us to be alone.

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:12.720
Fire!

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:26.060
Now no one will interfere.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:32.330
I made a promise, big brother.

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:36.260
I live in order to keep that promise.

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:39.400
I hid my social status, 
threw away my own future and

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:42.400
became Director of the Public 
Maintenance Department.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:48.640
My younger brother Rex, I've never 
forgotten the promise I made back then.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:54.610
17 years ago, I opened Pandora's Box.

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:59.960
Along with my left arm, I entrusted 
you with my final hope.

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:04.660
My body won't survive much longer.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:08.130
But before I die, there are 
the Signers led by the Crimson

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:11.630
Dragon and the Dark Signers led 
by the evil god of the underworld.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:18.150
I have to see with my own eyes which is the 
creator and which is the god of destruction.

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:23.110
The destiny from 17 years 
ago still lives today.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:28.000
Professor Fudo's spirit still 
lives inside his son Yusei Fudo.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:29.610
Rex.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:35.400
If I'm defeated, follow that destiny.

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:43.460
Brother, I've continued to think for the 
past 17 years and came to one conclusion.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:46.530
It's a new possibility that 
even you don't know about.

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:49.470
A new possibility?

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:52.550
You will now witness it.

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:04.920
There it is!

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:10.810
The Moment that Yusei's father 
created is located there.

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:16.030
Moment caused Zero Reverse, and City 
and Satellite were split apart.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.260
That's also when Yusei's father died.

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:21.920
What's wrong, Luca?

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:25.270
I sense terrifying power 
coming from that place.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:30.200
Luca, it's fine.  I'll protect you.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:34.230
It's huge!

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:38.180
It's like a crater created by a meteor.

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:39.480
We're finally here.

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:41.650
Yeah.  Let's go!

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:42.850
All right!

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:55.630
That's…

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:00.190
Public Maintenance Department?

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.120
I'll check it out.

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:34.740
Yusei!

00:11:34.740 --> 00:11:35.710
Stay back!

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:43.500
You're here, Yusei.  You sent your former 
friend plunging into the depths of hell.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:48.470
You're wrong!  There should've 
been no hate between me and Kiryu!

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:52.460
The Dark Signers took advantage 
of our misunderstanding!

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:57.130
Misunderstanding?  There was no 
misunderstanding.  It was fate.

00:11:57.130 --> 00:12:02.230
You were destined to risk your 
lives and hate each other.

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:08.650
Your hate and sadness created sparks, 
spinning Moment towards destruction!

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:11.380
Just like me and Professor Fudo!

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:12.830
What?

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:22.520
What was that?

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:26.800
It's beautiful.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:29.190
This is Moment's light.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:37.500
What's this?

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:39.570
Can you see it, Yusei?

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:45.580
This is the gateway to a new possibility 
that Professor Fudo and I discovered 17 years ago.

00:12:45.980 --> 00:12:50.750
The power to change this world is 
on the other side of the light.

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:55.640
Before long, this light will flow 
in and completely fill this world.

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:58.310
Even if that causes many casualties?

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:11.640
Rutger, I'll never forgive 
you for what you've done!

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:17.340
When facing a new possibility, it's 
inevitable that there will be some casualties.

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:18.540
Some?

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:25.750
Yusei, humans are tiny creatures that 
live in a wide expanse known as destiny.

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:30.420
Against destiny, individual 
lives vanish like trash.

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:33.960
Yusei, look at this beautiful light.

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:38.910
This light is destiny itself.  
This light is alive.

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:44.470
My destiny engulfed Professor 
Fudo's destiny and gave me life!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:48.470
You're insane!  I won't let 
you do whatever you want!

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:53.210
I'll bury you in this 
light.  Bring it, Yusei!

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:57.380
Yusei!

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:10.040
Duel!

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.170
Duel!

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:34.840
My turn.

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:42.240
I was looking forward to dueling 
you.  Now show me your power!

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:45.260
I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:49.700
All he did was set one card.  
Is he taking him lightly?

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.170
My turn.

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:56.150
He only has one set card on his 
field.  Is he trying to lure me in?

00:14:56.150 --> 00:15:00.680
But no matter what awaits 
me, all I can do is attack!

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:06.680
I can Special Summon this card by sending 
a monster in my hand to the graveyard.

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:11.420
I send Level Eater to the graveyard 
to Special Summon Quickdraw Synchron!

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:19.500
Then the effect of the Level Eater that 
I sent to the graveyard activates!

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:23.340
When this card is in the graveyard, 
I can Special Summon it by

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:27.340
lowering the Level of one Level 
5-or-above monster on the field by 1!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:33.670
Quickdraw Synchron can be substituted 
for a Tuner with "Synchron" in its name.

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:44.180
Level 4 Quickdraw Synchron 
tunes Level 1 Level Eater!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:50.390
The stars come together to call forth a new 
power!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.560
Synchro Summon!

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:55.130
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.540
Go, Junk Warrior!

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.780
Attack him directly!  Scrap Fist!

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:15.090
All right!

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.820
He did it!  Yusei got the first punch in!

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:21.420
At this moment, my trap activates!

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:23.540
Wolf in Sheep's Clothing!

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:27.360
When I take damage from your 
monster's direct attack,

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:31.360
I get to Special Summon a Level 
1 monster from my hand...

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:35.210
...and also Special Summon a monster 
with the same name from my deck!

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:38.680
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:43.880
They have 0 attack points!  
He has has no skills!

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:47.880
You're wrong.  He hasn't made 
a single pointless move.

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:51.860
That's because he has everything he needs 
to bring out his most powerful card.

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:59.250
Dark Signers have a terrifying card that 
can instantly change the course of battle.

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:03.300
He has two monsters right 
now that he can release.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:07.300
I can sense it.  Both of 
you, don't leave my side!

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:11.020
You mean an Earthbound 
Immortal is going to appear?

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:16.630
My turn!  I activate the Field 
Spell Spider Web from my hand!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:17.580
It's coming!

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:29.740
What is it?

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:38.700
Yusei, you can no longer 
escape from this spider web.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:41.480
I release two Dark Spiders!

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:48.620
Dead spirits that hide inside 
my light of destiny, give

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:53.920
me your power to bring true 
darkness to this changing world!

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:56.890
What's this?

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:03.290
Appear, Earthbound Immortal Uru!

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:34.990
Earthbound Immortal appeared!

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:36.990
Damn!

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:42.900
When there's a Field Spell, Earthbound 
Immortal can attack you directly.

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:46.870
Go, Earthbound Immortal 
Uru!  Attack Yusei directly!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.110
Hell Thread!

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:51.580
Yusei!

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.880
I activate my trap Synchro Barrier!

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:58.310
What?

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:02.530
With Synchro Barrier, by 
releasing one Synchro Monster

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:06.530
on the field, I can make battle 
damage become 0 this turn!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:09.450
You somehow managed to survive the attack.

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:11.760
I set two cards.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:17.100
I activate this spell card.  The 
Continuous Spell Destiny Activator!

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:22.890
When this card activates, I send the 
top card on my deck to the graveyard.

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:29.550
If the card you draw from now on is the same 
type as this card, your life points are halved.

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:32.930
The card I sent to the 
graveyard was a monster card!

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:39.020
Now it's your turn!  The card you 
draw next will affect your destiny!

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:40.990
My turn!

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:44.190
It's a trap card.

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:46.200
You're lucky.

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:50.650
He can't let his guard down yet.

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:54.570
How is Yusei planning to battle 
against Earthbound Immortal?

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:56.870
I summon Speed Warrior!

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:03.650
Earthbound Immortal is a deceptive monster 
that can't be the target of attack.

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:08.090
He has 1700 life points 
remaining.  In that case...

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:10.230
I activate Speed Warrior's effect!

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:13.980
On the turn that it's successfully 
summoned, its attack points are doubled!

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:17.190
Go, Speed Warrior!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.200
Attack Rutger directly!

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:22.670
All right!  If this attack 
succeeds, Yusei wins!

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.130
Not good enough, Yusei!

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:26.100
I activate my Continuous Trap!

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:27.890
Roar of the Earthbound!

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:33.140
Your attacking monster is destroyed, and you 
take damage equal to half its attack points!

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:41.220
I set one card and end my turn.

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:42.690
My turn.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:47.870
Can you keep dodging Earthbound 
Immortal's attacks, Yusei?

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:51.430
Go, Uru!  Attack Yusei directly!

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:52.660
Hell Thread!

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:56.630
I activate my trap Spirit Force!

00:20:57.410 --> 00:21:01.630
For one time only, the battle 
damage I take becomes 0.

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:05.590
Then I can add one monster in my graveyard 
with 1500-or-fewer defense points to my hand!

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:08.650
Yusei, it looks like this is the end.

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:09.110
What?

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:12.080
My Counter Trap Earthbound Wave!

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:17.240
It negates one of your spell or 
trap card's activation and effect!

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:18.500
Oh no!

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:24.700
Yusei!

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:25.630
Yusei!

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:37.070
Yusei, I'll soon send you into the 
light where your father rests.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:01.800
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:06.920
We will build our own future

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:12.360
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:17.530
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.130 --> 00:22:32.670
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.100 --> 00:22:38.250
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:42.950
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:48.220
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:52.690
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:58.270
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.400 --> 00:23:03.140
This journey has no end

00:23:03.370 --> 00:23:08.610
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:13.850
Hear my voice
